<title>USA: Corpus Christi Bancshares merger approved.</title>
<headline>Corpus Christi Bancshares merger approved.</headline>
<dateline>CORPUS CHRISTI, Texas 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Corpus Christi Bancshares Inc said shareholders have approved its merger with Cullen/Frost Bankers Inc.</p>
<p>Under the merger, which is expected to be completed within 30 days, Cullen/Frost is acquiring Corpus Christi and its subsidiary, Citizens State Bank of Corpus Christi.</p>
<p>Cullen/Frost is paying $18.84 per Corpus Christi share, or $33 million.</p>
